times new roman;margin:0px"><strong>Less cash and cash equivalents of discontinued operations - end of year</strong></p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 1px solid;width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 1px solid;width:9%;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;"><strong><ix:nonFraction id="fid_335" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CashCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndRestrictedCashEquivalentsIncludingDisposalGroupAndDiscontinuedOperations" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" format="ixt:zerodash" decimals="0">-</ix:nonFraction></strong></td><td style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 1px;width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 1px solid;width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 1px solid;width:9%;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;"><strong><ix:nonFraction id="fid_336" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CashCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndRestrictedCashEquivalentsIncludingDisposalGroupAndDiscontinuedOperations" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-30" format="ixt:zerodash" decimals="0">-</ix:nonFraction></strong></td><td style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 1px;width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#ffffff"><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px"><strong>Cash and cash equivalents of continuing operations - end of year</strong></p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;fon