times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><ix:nonNumeric id="fid_435" name="pavs:BusinessCombinationPlaceOfIncorporation" contextRef="From2025-04-01to2025-09-30_pavs_HainanParanovousTechnologyCoLtdMember">PRC</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><ix:nonNumeric id="fid_455" name="pavs:BusinessAcquisitionEffectiveDateOfincorporation" contextRef="From2025-04-01to2025-09-30_pavs_HainanParanovousTechnologyCoLtdMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen">June 17, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;">N/a</p></td><td><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><ix:nonNumeric id="fid_434" name="pavs:BusinessCombinationMinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" contextRef="From2025-04-01to2025-09-30_pavs_HainanParanovousTechnologyCoLtdMember">100% by Paranovous HK</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><ix:nonNumeric id="fid_433" name="pavs:BusinessCombinationPrincipalActivities" contextRef="From2025-04-01to2025-09-30_pavs_HainanParanovousTechnologyCoLtdMember">Entertainment</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#cceeff"><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: